abstract: >-
  AeroBIM checks a design and working documentation pack against itself:
  IFC 2x3, 4 and 4x3 models, IDS 1.0 rules, drawings, schedules and declared
  calculation tables. Numbers are compared in a decimal tolerance band. A
  deterministic gate sets the pack verdict, and language-model output stays
  advisory. Reports export as JSON, HTML, PDF and BCF 2.1/3.0. A reproducible
  Russian AEC extraction benchmark (10 fixtures, 50 requirements) is enforced
  in CI (macro F1 >= 0.70).
